Yocto BSP layer for UC1.1
==========================================================================

hw-partition-1.1 contains two cohort layers:
* meta-alb-hw-partition-1.1.5 - generates Linux images for Cohort 5 which:
  - boots from uSDHC,
  - owns SMMU,
  - uses UART0 as console.
* meta-alb-hw-partition-1.1.6 - generates Linux images for Cohort 6 which:
  - boots from UFS,
  - uses UART7 as console.

Low Memory Layout:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Each cohort has 0x1c000000 assigned space in Low memory, split as follows

0x00000000 – 0x10000000: to be used for Linux CMA (256MB)
0x10000000 – 0x12000000: reserved for HSE (32MB)
0x13000000 - 0x13001000: reserved for SCMI firmware shared memory
0x13002000 - 0x13200000: Linux device tree
0x13200000 - 0x16000000: Kernel Image
0x16000000 - 0x16000000: RootFS
...
BL33_DTB
BL33_ENTRYPOINT
BL2_BASE
BL31_BASE
...
0x1bFFFFFF: DDR_END
